1
00:00:00,584 --> 00:00:03,614
(Sheldon:)Oh, that seems overly harsh.

2
00:00:04,488 --> 00:00:07,478
(Sheldon:)You gave in to a human weakness.
You didn't kill a man.

3
00:00:08,258 --> 00:00:11,718
(Sheldon:)You know, it's a tad old-school...

4
00:00:11,928 --> 00:00:14,628
(Sheldon:)...but my father was not one
to spare the rod...

5
00:00:14,865 --> 00:00:19,265
(Sheldon:)...when my brother would sneak into his truck
and drink his driving whiskey.

6
00:00:21,772 --> 00:00:24,902
Are you saying you wanna spank me?

7
00:00:27,310 --> 00:00:29,870
(Sheldon:)I don't want to...

8
00:00:31,148 --> 00:00:33,808
(Sheldon:)...but it looks like you left me no choice.

9
00:00:36,486 --> 00:00:37,886
(Amy:)That's true.

10
00:00:41,158 --> 00:00:44,248
(Amy:)I've been a very bad girl.

11
00:00:48,498 --> 00:00:50,468
(Howard:)Hi-ho, hi-ho, it's off to fish we go.

12
00:00:52,803 --> 00:00:55,003
- That's what you're wearing?
- No good?

13
00:00:55,205 --> 00:00:58,935
(Howard:)The guy at the sporting goods store
said these are what fishermen wear.

14
00:00:59,443 --> 00:01:02,023
(Mr. Rostenkowski:)Maybe in cartoons.

